      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon",
      "notes": "smoked"
    },
    {
      "name": "Salt",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon",
      "notes": "to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "Black pepper",
      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon",
      "notes": "to taste"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Cut the tops off the rocoto peppers and remove the seeds and membranes.",
    "In a large skillet, heat the olive oil over medium heat and saute the onion and garlic until softened.",
    "Add the namul, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper to the skillet and stir to combine.",
    "Stuff each rocoto pepper with the semolina rimacinata and namul mixture, filling to the top.",
    "Place the stuffed peppers in a baking dish and cover with vegan cheese shreds.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for a few minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
  ],
